# Force LF line endings for anything that runs as a Linux shell script or
# systemd unit, regardless of the committer's OS/autocrlf setting - CRLF in
# a shebang script fails on Linux with "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
airootfs-profile/airootfs/usr/local/bin/* text eol=lf
